{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "7c6ed0fa2e3401b898f656aeba1965d2f7f69096e33e652019fda6998c093c24", "ja": "捻じ曲がる定め", "zh": "扭曲的宿命", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b72d4e04505607f364cf5cff7f2530ccea883ed4a4544ea58b11c797938f2ad9", "ja": "繰り返し見る儀式の悪夢に、恐慌状態に陥る\n夜羽那。その怯えた心の隙を突くように、\n深淵海は「儀式は凛音亞ではなく、永混に\n行わせよう」と甘言を囁く。深淵海の目論見\nどおり、永混は儀式を成功させるが……。", "zh": "夜羽那因反复梦见仪式的噩梦而陷入恐慌。深渊海趁着她恐惧的心灵露出破绽，低声说着甜言蜜语：“不要让凛音亞，而是让永混来进行仪式吧。”正如深渊海所谋划的那样，永混成功完成了仪式，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1000_035hin", "source_sha256": "219d33e0f197087b5dfab8cd570ded25866492a54c27247e235cdb45b0bf6ec6", "ja": "キャーアアアアアア！！！", "zh": "啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1001_se", "source_sha256": "b2bbb4a4923d33103f1754f0368f1b6446c121515a8a1b013786a0effb0d8cbf", "ja": "ガッシャーーーン！", "zh": "哐啷————！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "c57fd8bdbc4f5bd02edc8cbd6c44bece6c4f62fb05d169eefdf2469b169ff5ba", "ja": "カーテンを閉めて！\n……早く！", "zh": "把窗帘拉上！\n……快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "3840831fdb9c3e6814ee4f1f4d442f6093662b91757c69f8cd8d29ad0535aab2", "ja": "何をグズグズしているの！\n早くしなさいったら！", "zh": "你还磨磨蹭蹭什么！\n都说了快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1004_shiyonin", "source_sha256": "445469455d896277a78bf6180c5d88925325b3872cd4afc4b7b1c7937e9ed474", "ja": "やれやれ、またお嬢様が……\nガラスを手に入れるのも大変だというのに。", "zh": "哎呀呀，大小姐又……\n玻璃本来就很难弄到手啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1005_shiyonin", "source_sha256": "0b4715e8345f4ca303223e7e223fe4a5bf72a876f62f5ce51f17884c76a39b19", "ja": "夜羽那お嬢様のヒステリーはいつもの事だが、\n今日はいつにも増して機嫌が悪いな。", "zh": "夜羽那大小姐歇斯底里虽是家常便饭，\n但今天的心情比以往还要差呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "17ce3ae8bd50e2a8472f42af7050864ca9b19119bb31c44223f0b7acda158c01", "ja": "まあまあ、君達。無理もないよ。\n彼女は父親を亡くしたばかりなんだし……。", "zh": "好啦好啦，你们几个。这也难怪啊。\n毕竟她才刚失去父亲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "6fe5de12133d2f360f4b741f67aceecefad55950e387e0c72ba4623602969491", "ja": "それに村長といっても、まだ14歳。ほんの子ども\nじゃないか。お嬢さんの様子は、私が見て来よう。", "zh": "而且，虽说是村长，也才14岁。还只是个孩子嘛。\n我去看看那位小姐的情况吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1008_shiyonin", "source_sha256": "fae1ba9cd56c43c408eefa58613d82530344410a7242e69db875dd1b6582e532", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます。\n……お若いのに、深淵海先生はよく出来たお方だ。", "zh": "啊，谢谢您。\n……年纪轻轻，深渊海先生真是位了不起的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1009_shiyonin", "source_sha256": "98d285fae91d9c27f2c76023ed11f9909316acf370c59020fb13d0f6ccd064dd", "ja": "だなぁ……。", "zh": "是啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1010_se", "source_sha256": "c01f9901aa06ad650b314d5a929022d1574a5f17402b31fd5bd6359592e719d6", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "f868174e10931ec5fd71c7022f87fa0f110aa0c001da6bfe9b638690a9f79032", "ja": "失礼。\n……大丈夫かい？　夜羽那お嬢さん。", "zh": "打扰了。\n……你没事吧？夜羽那小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "edfd45ffefffbdca49676615cbb6adce3eb06ee1272f165a5e2115b43ca1239a", "ja": "……恐ろしい夢を見るんです。儀式を行ったのに、\n皆が死んでしまう夢を、何度も何度も……。", "zh": "……我做了好可怕的梦。梦见明明举行了仪式，\n大家却还是死去了……一遍又一遍地……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "613da27baf4aaf6b8f2e7b102dd092ab9824976dbf28da0daa757f305bb138b5", "ja": "その事なんだけど……\nやはり、儀式は行うべきだと私は思う。", "zh": "关于那件事……\n我还是觉得，应该举行仪式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "b8b7d88daf34e3a1160bc8eda70a7604f4587ec12430f95150b5b918dd236972", "ja": "けど……！", "zh": "可是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "1f2e5cc25e6ee62040a2202a0a83114691916f160e2b1064ac743641e39e1e2b", "ja": "いい方法があるんだ。……村の誰か。たとえば\n永混を、君達の身代わりにするというのはどうかな？", "zh": "我有个好办法。……把村里的某个人，\n比如让永混来代替你们，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "1e4c196be447b8416cfd80c30f429319566654de230172890878b9fada0e4136", "ja": "……『神降ろし』は村長の役目。私か、\n凛音亞を指名しなければならないと、父が……。", "zh": "……“降神”是村长的职责。父亲说过，\n必须由我，或者指名凛音亚才行……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1017_009rit", "source_sha256": "5042c7e38762f3272a50d8edd7c8673f24dd6685a4602896363d1063a7109cad", "ja": "「但し、誰かが身代わりを名乗り出た時は、\n移行しても構わない」……違ったかな？", "zh": "“‘不过，若是有人主动提出代替，\n也可以进行转让’……我没记错吧？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "eac7e64ae76cf1f58c9eb87ef10032ff23b2bf4316c52130ea5c3f0ced1845c0", "ja": "儀式の前に、予め永混に伝えるんですか？\n『凛音亞が選ばれる』と……。", "zh": "要在仪式前，提前告诉永混吗？\n说“凛音亚会被选中”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "0545604e59726d44a4ef555adfc0eee7fa611a8c8536f1a0fe984dd27347d0ee", "ja": "永混ならきっと、体の弱い凛音亞を庇います。\nけど、自分の命を賭けてまでなんて……。", "zh": "如果是永混，一定会保护身体虚弱的凛音亞。可是，竟然要赌上自己的性命……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "da4385611fad243b734c9b53519423dd598b67ad3ca013d9038728b73958438d", "ja": "庇う。何故かはわからないが、\nそれだけは間違いないと思えるんだ。", "zh": "会庇护的。虽然我也不明白是为什么，\n但唯独这件事，我坚信绝不会有错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "9130b367a44b3e2d387d1827d7805b5764f1594cf3945a0e000a780d5aa06290", "ja": "心配いらない。君のお姉さんは助かり、村も守られる。\n神はきっと、君の願いを聞き遂げてくれるはずだ。", "zh": "不用担心。你的姐姐会得救，村子也会得到保护。\n神明一定会答应你的祈愿的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1022_035hin", "source_sha256": "22005222a732b7a7098be3aaf812ccbd93378014e07f093ed2e15ec9d99d821b", "ja": "深淵海先生……。", "zh": "深渊海老师……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1023_009rit", "source_sha256": "ba4a5411f942eedfb805e79fa0f065b76c7cf02290fedcf18b12e0e47cc9fe79", "ja": "真実を伝えれば、恐らくは正しく繰り返される。\nそれは何度も見てきた事なんだ。彼らにとっても。", "zh": "若是传达了真相，恐怕又会如出一辙地再次重演。\n这种事我已经见过好多次了。对他们而言也是一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1024_009rit", "source_sha256": "34c1593fa5630f2e1b39ddb5b45a0dd8d6444c9a8f9cca706f0001eeef30a69a", "ja": "では、伝えなかったとしたらどうなる？\nあるいは……違う真実を、伝えたとしたら？", "zh": "那么，如果没有传达，又会怎样？\n或者……如果传达了另一个真相呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1025_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1026_037nao", "source_sha256": "7edd9c95cd945df85d5b6a0edfe6e7834f44ac2debe1386428868b4d94ffc175", "ja": "待ってください！　凛音亞は病弱なんです。\nだったら、私が代わりにやります！", "zh": "请等一下！凛音亚她身体虚弱。\n既然这样，就由我来代替她吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1027_009rit", "source_sha256": "6bc5aace3fce053158175d7e0130ccdb4dd0974d635afb4b114a997bf8b59fa9", "ja": "……フフッ。", "zh": "……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1028_null", "source_sha256": "029302594bfa08e4d9c2e8e735127d4beb41cb6d1efc166c2ae5202609ecce09", "ja": "……儀式は無事、成功した。\nだが……。", "zh": "……仪式顺利成功了。\n但是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1029_009rit", "source_sha256": "a49b7eb6af9fd7c85acc682efba8a446c5b31d356018de5b37565c41da1ddf52", "ja": "『凛音亞だと都合が悪い』なら、永混でもいいのでは？\nそれに、儀式は失敗しなかった。違うかい？", "zh": "如果说『凛音亚不合适』，那永混不也行吗？\n而且仪式并没有失败。不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1030_040tam", "source_sha256": "e7643b65c5da1dfafa7c9c8b2fa300d15b1edb200645cee822cb355f3a1487a1", "ja": "……まあ、君達がそれでいいならいいけど。", "zh": "……算了，只要你们觉得没问题的话就行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1031_009rit", "source_sha256": "36a366b4673d87737a05ed17036a36a20c0dad97357ab9c75871b38520460d28", "ja": "こんなに上手く行くとは思わなかった。\nこれで新たな結果が得られれば、万々歳だ！", "zh": "没想到会这么顺利。\n如果这样能得到新的结果，那就太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_07_1032_009rit", "source_sha256": "84d5a1357e03faa2f99ef01dfbf271a4ac24f2bb85ac1871d242068e822b2d8d", "ja": "しかし……\nあれは、どういう意味なんだ……？", "zh": "可是……\n那到底是什么意思……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
